WEBVTT

00:05.930 --> 00:08.250
So this is Avancia?

00:08.250 --> 00:10.150
It's a tranquil town.

00:10.420 --> 00:14.110
Yeah. There's not much out here 
in the country, but it's a nice place.

00:14.690 --> 00:17.070
I hope you like it.

00:17.440 --> 00:19.400
Rud!

00:22.000 --> 00:23.750
How long ya staying this time?

00:24.170 --> 00:28.350
If you're here for a while, 
let's hang out. Just the two of us.

00:30.010 --> 00:33.920
Rud! So today's the day 
you were coming back, huh?

00:38.620 --> 00:40.880
It's good to see you two.

00:40.880 --> 00:42.680
What brought you here?

00:43.100 --> 00:45.180
I'm buying a hammer.

00:45.180 --> 00:47.520
And Fille's on patrol, aren't you?

00:47.520 --> 00:51.650
Yeah. I went to check on 
Manicia, too. She's doing well.

00:52.320 --> 00:53.570
I see.

00:54.700 --> 00:58.950
Thanks. I don't have to worry 
when I go off on adventures,

00:58.950 --> 01:01.540
because the whole town 
watches out for my sister.

01:01.970 --> 01:03.760
There's no need to thank us.

01:03.760 --> 01:05.500
By the way, who's this?

01:06.100 --> 01:08.400
This is Luna. I met her on my travels.

01:08.940 --> 01:13.670
She has nowhere to go, 
so I thought I'd look after her for a while.

01:14.100 --> 01:15.520
I see.

01:16.600 --> 01:20.600
Hello, Luna. I'm Milena, 
the blacksmith's poster girl.

01:20.970 --> 01:22.040
Nice to meet you.

01:23.810 --> 01:24.890
C'mon, you're next.

01:24.890 --> 01:29.030
What? Uh, I'm Fille.

01:29.030 --> 01:32.360
I work as a sub-leader for the town watch.

01:33.650 --> 01:35.450
Fille's shy.

01:35.450 --> 01:36.770
Don't say that, Rud!

01:57.050 --> 02:06.890
<b>The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids</b>

01:57.050 --> 02:06.890
<b>Labyrinth Raids</b>

01:57.050 --> 02:06.890
m 124 277 l 134 267 140 274 144 272 150 275 163 260 177 271 472 271 488 261 502 275 507 270 510 274 518 267 528 277 516 288 526 298 517 306 510 299 506 304 500 299 489 312 473 302 178 302 163 313 150 300 146 303 140 299 134 306 125 297 134 287

01:57.050 --> 02:06.890
A Tank with a Rare 9,999 Resistance Skill 
Got Kicked from the Hero's Party

03:18.540 --> 03:21.930
My sister might be sleeping.

03:22.400 --> 03:24.360
Be quiet so we don't wake her.

03:25.670 --> 03:27.140
<i>This smell...</i>

03:27.860 --> 03:30.550
<i>They're all tomato dishes I love.</i>

03:35.140 --> 03:37.360
Welcome home, dear brother.

03:40.860 --> 03:50.200
Who's she?

03:51.740 --> 03:53.630
I'm home, Manicia!

03:54.840 --> 03:57.450
This is Luna. I met her on my way here.

03:57.450 --> 04:01.600
She's going through some stuff. 
I invited her to come stay with us.

04:01.600 --> 04:03.200
I see.

04:03.200 --> 04:05.870
<i>Ah, I haven't seen Manicia in forever!</i>

04:05.870 --> 04:07.350
<i>She's so cute.</i>

04:07.980 --> 04:10.860
<i>For a moment, I thought 
a goddess had descended.</i>

04:11.670 --> 04:14.700
It's nice to meet you, Luna. I'm Manicia.

04:14.700 --> 04:18.490
I can't offer you much, 
but please make yourself at home.

04:19.390 --> 04:21.240
Thank you.

04:21.500 --> 04:25.040
Come on, dear brother. 
You must be tired from your long journey.

04:25.040 --> 04:27.390
Have a seat and eat.

04:29.020 --> 04:31.340
I'll prepare a second serving.

04:31.340 --> 04:34.120
Wait. You're still weak. 
You shouldn't strain yourself.

04:34.380 --> 04:37.000
I'm feeling good today. I'll be fine.

04:37.000 --> 04:39.090
Uh, in that case, let's cook together. Okay?

04:40.220 --> 04:42.920
All right. Let's do that, then.

04:43.370 --> 04:46.600
U-Um, Ms. Manicia's hair...

04:46.600 --> 04:50.390
Oh, right. Is this your first time seeing 
someone with a physical idiosyncrasy?

04:50.870 --> 04:56.520
In Manicia's case, it's her hair. 
It moves according to her emotions.

04:56.520 --> 04:58.360
I see.

04:58.870 --> 05:04.320
Manicia, you seemed to know I was coming 
home. Was that because of your skill?

05:04.320 --> 05:07.320
Yes. It was just a feeling I had.

05:07.700 --> 05:11.710
And you made my favorite 
dishes just off a feeling?

05:11.710 --> 05:14.190
You're gonna make me cry tears of joy.

05:14.190 --> 05:15.790
Are you an idiot?

05:16.130 --> 05:18.410
You two are very close.

05:18.890 --> 05:21.360
Isn't this normal?

05:24.810 --> 05:27.470
Aren't you supposed to
 be helping, dear brother?

05:31.690 --> 05:33.190
Thanks for the meal.

05:35.100 --> 05:38.930
That's an unusual way to hold a spoon, Luna.

05:40.210 --> 05:42.030
I-I'm sorry.

05:43.070 --> 05:46.240
I've only used one a handful of times.

05:56.670 --> 05:58.170
I'm sorry.

05:58.450 --> 06:00.150
I'll get it right next time.

06:00.150 --> 06:01.400
Hey, Luna...

06:00.680 --> 06:03.040
No need to apologize.

06:08.410 --> 06:10.350
This is how you hold one.

06:17.360 --> 06:21.690
I'll teach you things one at a time, 
so take your time learning, okay?

06:24.280 --> 06:26.620
Thank you.

06:41.560 --> 06:46.130
Mr. Rud, Ms. Manicia, good morning.

06:47.260 --> 06:48.810
You made all this yourself?

06:48.810 --> 06:54.100
Yes. These are all things Ms. Manicia has 
taught me how to make over the past three days.

06:56.220 --> 06:57.310
So good!

06:57.850 --> 07:00.020
<i>It tastes exactly like Manicia's cooking.</i>

07:00.980 --> 07:05.980
<i>Luna has mastered every basic 
life skill in a short amount of time.</i>

07:06.730 --> 07:10.700
<i>Is this how quickly homunculi learn?</i>

07:10.990 --> 07:12.080
Dear brother.

07:13.190 --> 07:18.120
It's nice out today.
 Why don't we show Luna around town?

07:18.480 --> 07:22.320
Good idea. I'd like to 
introduce her to everyone.

07:22.320 --> 07:25.840
Okay, I'll lend you some 
of my clothes to go out in.

07:26.480 --> 07:28.880
I have some I think will look nice on you.

07:29.980 --> 07:33.550
<i>Manicia's so cute when 
she's acting like a big sister.</i>

07:33.970 --> 07:37.380
But these clothes are 
a bit difficult to put on.

07:37.380 --> 07:39.020
Shall I help you change?

07:42.280 --> 07:44.150
I-I'm sorry.

07:44.490 --> 07:46.610
I can get changed by myself.

07:48.230 --> 07:51.400
Did I do something to upset her?

07:51.880 --> 07:56.870
<i>She was probably worried about 
Manicia noticing her magic stone.</i>

08:01.400 --> 08:04.300
Avancia doesn't have an
 adventurers' guild or a church.

08:05.060 --> 08:07.840
It has one blacksmith
and one apothecary.

08:07.840 --> 08:11.870
Its most remarkable feature 
is probably the nearby orchard.

08:11.870 --> 08:13.970
Well, if it isn't Rud.

08:14.720 --> 08:17.280
Here to make a granddaughter
 with my daughter?

08:17.280 --> 08:19.390
No, Mr. Raisil.

08:20.000 --> 08:22.410
Luna, this is Milena's father.

08:22.410 --> 08:25.600
I've heard about you. 
Nice to meet you, miss.

08:25.860 --> 08:27.290
Th-Thank you.

08:28.230 --> 08:30.280
Oh, right. Mr. Raisil.

08:31.630 --> 08:35.990
I see. So your magic sword
 was taken from you.

08:35.990 --> 08:38.700
All right! It's a favor for you, after all.

08:40.390 --> 08:43.430
I'll make you something 
incredible in no time.

08:43.430 --> 08:45.110
Thank you.

08:45.110 --> 08:47.540
Do you mind if my daughter helps out?

08:47.540 --> 08:50.910
Like me, she's quite skilled.

08:50.910 --> 08:52.050
Go right ahead.

08:52.430 --> 08:54.590
I'll come by again when it's done.

08:54.590 --> 08:59.670
Oh, wait. Why don't you show 
Luna the monstrous farm?

09:01.490 --> 09:05.480
Put simply, monstrous vegetables 
are plants that grow into monsters.

09:05.930 --> 09:09.940
They only need mana to grow,
 so they can be grown year-round.

09:10.370 --> 09:11.940
They're nutritious, too.

09:12.640 --> 09:14.280
Hey, it's Rud.

09:14.280 --> 09:15.900
Oh, he's got a girlfriend!

09:16.220 --> 09:20.160
She's not my girlfriend. This girl's name 
is Luna. We're traveling companions.

09:20.160 --> 09:22.920
Now that I think about it, 
you'd never get a girlfriend.

09:22.920 --> 09:24.720
You're obsessed with your sis.

09:24.720 --> 09:27.000
Who taught you to say that?

09:27.360 --> 09:29.700
That's what Fille said.

09:30.850 --> 09:32.170
You kids!

09:33.410 --> 09:35.400
Why are you hanging around?

09:36.530 --> 09:38.240
Get back to work.

09:48.900 --> 09:50.740
It's Grandma Gigi!

09:51.200 --> 09:53.540
I see you're as energetic as ever.

09:53.540 --> 09:55.560
Well, if it isn't Rud.

09:59.240 --> 10:00.940
And your girlfriend?

10:00.940 --> 10:02.160
No!

10:02.830 --> 10:05.160
Luna, this is Grandma Gigi.

10:05.860 --> 10:07.960
She's the town's apothecary.

10:07.960 --> 10:11.190
She makes medicines for Manicia.

10:11.190 --> 10:13.130
It's nice to meet you, Luna.

10:13.620 --> 10:15.090
Th-Thank you.

10:16.190 --> 10:19.800
She reminds me of how Manicia used to be.

10:23.800 --> 10:24.530
Yeah.

10:25.340 --> 10:28.860
I wish I could've done more to help.

10:28.860 --> 10:31.930
But my medicines can only do so much for her.

10:31.930 --> 10:33.790
You've done plenty.

10:33.790 --> 10:37.030
She says she feels a lot 
better now, thanks to you.

10:37.360 --> 10:38.490
Oh, really?

10:38.930 --> 10:42.950
If you need anything, Luna, 
come visit my shop anytime.

10:43.210 --> 10:46.890
All you youngsters are like my children.

10:46.890 --> 10:47.920
Oh, right.

10:48.640 --> 10:51.140
I'm about to harvest some spinach.

10:51.140 --> 10:53.000
Would you like to come with me?

10:53.000 --> 10:56.210
Oh? Rud finally brought a woman home.

10:56.210 --> 10:58.180
Are you over your sister?

11:00.710 --> 11:03.800
Okay, don't go crazy today.

11:24.860 --> 11:25.580
Sorry.

11:26.270 --> 11:30.490
Out here in the sticks, their only
 entertainment is other people's romances.

11:30.490 --> 11:31.290
It's fine.

11:32.020 --> 11:36.750
In your case, since you're so pretty,
 everyone wants to look after you all the more.

11:37.040 --> 11:37.700
What?

11:37.700 --> 11:41.940
Oh, uh, nothing. Wh-Why don't you try 
some of those freshly picked veggies?

11:41.940 --> 11:43.260
R-Right.

11:46.800 --> 11:48.270
It's good.

11:48.660 --> 11:51.540
I'm glad. The others will 
be delighted to hear that.

11:53.270 --> 11:59.260
I know the pace of life is slower in 
this town than in others, but I like it here.

12:01.120 --> 12:02.660
What did you think, Luna?

12:05.070 --> 12:07.450
Everyone is so considerate.

12:08.410 --> 12:11.790
I'm glad I got to come to such a nice town.

12:12.980 --> 12:17.680
I'd be so happy if I could stay here forever.

12:22.730 --> 12:26.010
Do you recognize this thing on my chest?

12:27.040 --> 12:29.530
It's a magic stone.

12:30.970 --> 12:32.180
That's right.

12:32.810 --> 12:34.980
You may find this hard to believe,

12:35.330 --> 12:37.650
but I'm not human.

12:38.230 --> 12:43.680
I'm a battle homunculus that was developed 
in the neighboring nation of Brunkels.

12:44.700 --> 12:47.910
I'm sorry for not telling you sooner.

12:48.730 --> 12:50.870
I didn't want to.

12:51.340 --> 12:56.200
I thought you'd kill me 
if you knew I was a homunculus.

12:57.440 --> 13:00.300
But you rescued me.

13:01.310 --> 13:04.760
It hurt me to continue lying to you.

13:06.620 --> 13:07.380
Sorry.

13:08.920 --> 13:11.180
There's something I haven't told you, too.

13:11.760 --> 13:15.640
I actually knew you were a homunculus.

13:16.320 --> 13:19.200
I happened to see your
 magic stone when we first met.

13:19.630 --> 13:23.410
Then, why did you help me?

13:24.380 --> 13:28.990
Before coming here, 
Manicia and I lived in the slums.

13:29.440 --> 13:33.330
Your eyes looked like hers did back then.

13:33.330 --> 13:34.960
I couldn't just leave you.

13:35.780 --> 13:41.180
But even when we lived there, 
we never forgot how it felt to be human.

13:42.910 --> 13:44.630
What about you?

13:45.300 --> 13:48.590
Will you live as a homunculus or as a human?

13:49.120 --> 13:53.620
Will you tell me how you feel?

13:55.600 --> 13:57.810
But I'm a homunculus.

13:58.570 --> 14:01.270
That's unrealistic.

14:02.370 --> 14:07.180
Is it? I've never heard that 
homunculi can't become humans.

14:08.240 --> 14:12.700
Besides, I enter labyrinths 
for a similar reason.

14:13.680 --> 14:20.310
To cure Manicia's illness, I'm searching for the
 Secret Treasure that may or may not exist.

14:21.160 --> 14:25.130
So we're both chasing shadows.

14:26.080 --> 14:28.090
Don't you think we'd get along?

14:33.230 --> 14:34.300
I...

14:35.680 --> 14:37.130
<i>In this place...</i>

14:38.590 --> 14:40.730
<i>With this person...</i>

14:41.410 --> 14:44.210
<i>Perhaps I could wish for that.</i>

14:45.670 --> 14:46.690
I...

14:47.870 --> 14:49.700
would like to live as a human.

14:51.360 --> 14:52.450
Okay.

14:53.440 --> 14:55.790
Then I look forward to knowing you, Luna.

14:55.790 --> 14:58.830
Thank you. I look forward 
to it as well, master.

14:58.830 --> 15:03.270
What? Doesn't "master" sound like 
something a homunculus would say?

15:03.270 --> 15:04.540
Does it?

15:05.630 --> 15:09.510
But for some reason, 
I wanted to call you that.

15:10.340 --> 15:11.470
I see.

15:14.720 --> 15:18.390
Ms. Manicia, there's something
 I'd like to discuss with you.

15:20.350 --> 15:21.450
Are you sure?

15:21.450 --> 15:25.500
Yes. I don't want to hide it
from those I'm close to.

15:26.720 --> 15:28.530
I am a homunculus.

15:29.040 --> 15:32.200
I'm sorry for not telling you sooner.

15:35.290 --> 15:38.910
I did think you were a little different.

15:39.210 --> 15:42.350
Will you keep being my friend?

15:43.230 --> 15:44.350
Of course.

15:48.820 --> 15:52.070
You knew everything, didn't you?

15:53.490 --> 15:56.600
<i>You help those who no one else will.</i>

15:57.440 --> 16:03.180
<i>You always, always have, dear brother.</i>

16:05.640 --> 16:07.610
It's finally over.

16:11.520 --> 16:13.530
Good work today, master.

16:13.820 --> 16:18.330
You, too, Luna. Sorry for 
having you help us clean.

16:18.330 --> 16:19.870
It's all right.

16:19.870 --> 16:23.530
Still, this is an incredible mansion.

16:25.020 --> 16:28.040
I made tea, everyone.

16:28.040 --> 16:28.970
What?!

16:28.970 --> 16:31.420
Tea made by Manicia?!

16:31.420 --> 16:32.260
Hurry!

16:32.260 --> 16:32.970
Move!

16:33.280 --> 16:35.810
Ms. Manicia certainly is popular.

16:35.810 --> 16:36.470
Huh?

16:36.930 --> 16:40.390
The first cup is mine!

16:45.470 --> 16:49.330
Being first to drink your tea 
makes it taste even better.

16:49.330 --> 16:50.900
It's all the same.

16:51.470 --> 16:53.840
You really are obsessed 
with your sis, Rud.

16:53.840 --> 16:56.130
Stop saying that.

16:56.130 --> 16:57.830
How are you feeling, Manicia?

16:57.830 --> 17:00.870
I know you said you felt good today, 
but you've been helping around the place.

17:01.420 --> 17:04.910
All I did was make tea. 
You worry too much, dear brother.

17:04.910 --> 17:06.150
But...

17:07.140 --> 17:09.540
I may not be in great health,

17:10.330 --> 17:13.510
but I don't want to hold you back.

17:13.940 --> 17:15.470
Manicia...

17:15.720 --> 17:19.670
I'm always telling you, I've never 
once felt like you're holding me back.

17:19.670 --> 17:24.840
Hey, Rud! Now that we're done cleaning, 
let's duel. It's been a while.

17:24.840 --> 17:26.440
D-Duel?

17:26.800 --> 17:28.370
It's not for real.

17:29.260 --> 17:30.900
<i>This is perfect, actually.</i>

17:31.230 --> 17:35.110
Guys, mind if we fight after I duel Fille?

17:35.700 --> 17:36.780
Me?

17:38.630 --> 17:43.790
I see. You want to test your previously 
unknown skills in a mock battle.

17:44.200 --> 17:49.000
Yeah, and I figure I won't have to hold back
 against the town guard's sub-leader.

17:50.240 --> 17:54.460
The one whose absorb shield 
is depleted more loses. Sound good?

17:54.460 --> 17:54.960
Yeah.

17:57.170 --> 17:58.680
All right...

17:58.680 --> 17:59.720
Begin!

18:02.000 --> 18:04.000
They're not moving.

18:04.000 --> 18:07.600
Neither of their fighting 
styles emphasize speed.

18:07.840 --> 18:10.520
But the first to move will be...

18:15.020 --> 18:17.050
<i>Such a heavy blow.</i>

18:26.870 --> 18:30.790
<i>Fille's gotten stronger 
since we last fought.</i>

18:32.230 --> 18:34.630
<i>If one of those lands, I've lost.</i>

18:34.990 --> 18:37.090
Ms. Fille is strong.

18:37.640 --> 18:41.870
They're called the town guard, but they're just
 the youngsters who didn't move to the city.

18:41.870 --> 18:45.310
Few of them are skilled fighters.

18:46.200 --> 18:49.970
But Fille and my brother are special.

18:50.390 --> 18:55.020
They should be putting their 
skills to use in a bigger city.

18:55.420 --> 18:56.860
I see.

18:56.860 --> 18:59.120
Get him, Fille!

18:59.120 --> 19:01.680
Knock Rud on his butt for once!

19:02.170 --> 19:03.070
Master!

19:03.920 --> 19:05.700
You can do it!

19:05.700 --> 19:06.870
Brother!

19:10.820 --> 19:12.460
Looking away? You must be confident.

19:14.180 --> 19:16.200
<i>I suffered a scratch, but it's not a problem.</i>

19:16.200 --> 19:18.010
<i>I'll use this damage to...</i>

19:20.300 --> 19:21.760
He's off balance!

19:21.760 --> 19:24.100
Now's your chance, Fille!

19:26.760 --> 19:27.750
What?

19:35.060 --> 19:38.420
That one blow took out my absorb shield?

19:39.330 --> 19:42.360
Rud's finally learned an offensive skill.

19:42.360 --> 19:45.480
Doesn't Fille have a 2,500 value shield?

19:45.480 --> 19:48.580
How strong is his skill 
to blow through all that?

19:48.960 --> 19:50.800
You've gotten stronger.

19:50.800 --> 19:53.040
But I didn't stand a chance against you.

19:55.260 --> 19:58.460
Anyway, what was that 
incredible skill just now?

19:58.760 --> 20:01.600
Oh, right. It's called Life Conversion.

20:01.600 --> 20:05.800
It allows me to convert the 
 depleted shield power into strength.

20:06.220 --> 20:08.320
I can't use it all the time,

20:08.320 --> 20:13.690
but that mock battle taught me its 
offensive power is nothing to sneeze at.

20:13.920 --> 20:15.200
Thanks.

20:15.200 --> 20:17.760
I'm glad I was able to help.

20:19.370 --> 20:23.150
<i>Until now, I've focused 
on defending as a tank.</i>

20:24.110 --> 20:31.320
<i>But going forward, thanks to Life Conversion,
 I'll be able to participate in attacking.</i>

20:31.320 --> 20:33.330
Okay. Who's next?

20:33.330 --> 20:35.170
S-Something just came up.

20:35.170 --> 20:37.430
Oh, no! My stomach!

20:37.430 --> 20:39.490
That was amazing.

20:39.490 --> 20:40.880
You're right.

20:41.170 --> 20:43.200
My brother is truly amazing.

20:43.840 --> 20:46.550
In comparison, I'm...

20:48.000 --> 20:51.680
Mommy... Daddy... Brother...

20:51.680 --> 20:53.600
Where did you go?

20:54.190 --> 20:56.870
Apparently, she was abandoned.

20:56.870 --> 20:58.560
They say she has an incurable disease.

20:58.860 --> 21:01.940
They're just going to raise 
their older child, Rud, right?

21:01.940 --> 21:05.000
I saw them dragging him away.

21:07.360 --> 21:10.790
The way she's looking, 
I doubt she'll last long.

21:14.000 --> 21:15.210
Manicia!

21:19.190 --> 21:21.630
Good. So this is where you were.

21:22.170 --> 21:23.420
Brother!

21:29.150 --> 21:31.100
<i>Another dream about back then.</i>

21:33.650 --> 21:36.440
<i>My brother always comes 
to save me in the end.</i>

21:37.480 --> 21:41.820
<i>But is my brother happy?</i>

21:42.750 --> 21:45.280
<i>If it weren't for me,</i>

21:46.450 --> 21:51.550
<i>could my brother be living more freely?</i>
